<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Password Reset</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
  <p>Hi {{firstname}},</p>
  <p>You requested a password reset. Use the code below to reset your password:</p>
  <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 4px; margin: 20px 0;">
    {{code}}
  </div>
  <p>This code expires in 15 minutes. If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.</p>
</body>
</html>
